# Shared types (SSOT)

- All domain interfaces live in `shared/src/types/`
- Export via `@learners-high/shared`
- Frontend and backend **import from shared** — never duplicate type definitions
- Mongoose schemas in `backend/src/db/models/` must align with these types
- `StudySessionResult`: annotate as response-only DTO (not a MongoDB collection)

When adding/changing a field:

1. Update `shared/src/types` first
2. Update Mongoose schema
3. Update mappers/DTO serialization
4. Update API client types in `frontend/src/api/`
5. Run `npm run build -w @learners-high/shared`

See `docs/architecture.md` §1.1, §2
